  <h2>The High Cost of Excess Inventory</h2>
  <p>Traditional manufacturing requires massive upfront orders and 60-day lead times. For professional brands, this ties up capital and creates "dead stock" risk. The most successful brands in 2026 are switching to <strong>Agile Supply Chains</strong>.</p>

