  <h3>The Fitclo "Ready-to-Brand" Advantage</h3>
  <p>We maintain a permanent rolling inventory of high-performance staples (Leggings, Bras, Shorts) in our 16,000㎡ facility. This allows mature sellers to operate on a <strong>Just-In-Time</strong> basis:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Lower Inventory Burden:</strong> Order exactly what is selling, rather than guessing 6 months in advance.</li>
    <li><strong>7-14 Day Restock:</strong> Respond to a viral marketing campaign or unexpected sell-out in record time.</li>
    <li><strong>Maximized Cash Flow:</strong> Reinvest your capital into marketing and brand building instead of stagnant warehouse stock.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Scalability Without Friction</h3>
  <p>As your sales volume increases, our integrated supply chain scales with you. Our warehouse is organized for rapid pick-and-pack fulfillment, ensuring that even as you grow to 1,000+ units per week, your delivery speed remains constant.</p>

